WEBVTT

00:00:12.540 --> 00:00:15.740
<i>What is happiness?</i>

00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:24.370
Consequently, Gaia devised the Song of Destruction's ceremony to bring about the Salvation.

00:00:18.620 --> 00:00:20.740
<i>Is it similar to youth?</i>

00:00:21.740 --> 00:00:24.180
<i>What is youth, then?</i>

00:00:44.600 --> 00:00:46.230
<i>"Something radiant."</i>

00:00:46.900 --> 00:00:48.230
<i>That's what Kotori said.</i>

00:00:49.320 --> 00:00:50.480
<i>"How should I know?"</i>

00:00:50.480 --> 00:00:52.250
<i>"Waste of time thinking about it,"</i>

00:00:52.250 --> 00:00:53.240
Here they come.

00:00:53.240 --> 00:00:55.010
<i>said Yoshino, dismissively.</i>

00:00:57.200 --> 00:00:58.490
Let's go, you bastards!

00:01:00.740 --> 00:01:01.990
Take this!

00:01:05.020 --> 00:01:05.960
<i>A long time ago,</i>

00:01:07.340 --> 00:01:11.190
<i>someone said,
"Life is like walking a tightrope."</i>

00:01:13.240 --> 00:01:17.180
<i>All three of their opinions 
seemed correct to me.</i>

00:01:18.420 --> 00:01:19.680
<i>It's something dazzling,</i>

00:01:20.040 --> 00:01:21.240
<i>unknown,</i>

00:01:21.810 --> 00:01:23.210
<i>and terrifying.</i>

00:01:24.310 --> 00:01:25.520
<i>Of course it's hard to answer.</i>

00:01:26.520 --> 00:01:28.850
<i>Because there is no right answer
to that question.</i>

00:01:33.460 --> 00:01:34.360
<i>However,</i>

00:01:34.580 --> 00:01:38.900
<i>I decided to set out on 
a journey to look for it.</i>

00:01:40.480 --> 00:01:41.440
<i>Yes...</i>

00:01:42.240 --> 00:01:43.120
<i>All I wanted</i>

00:01:44.170 --> 00:01:45.580
<i>was to spend that thing</i>

00:01:46.590 --> 00:01:49.680
<i>called "youth" with everyone.</i>

00:01:59.090 --> 00:02:02.260
<i>That day, mankind heard it.</i>

00:02:19.520 --> 00:02:21.160
Help me!

00:02:23.380 --> 00:02:25.390
Hey, what're you doing?!

00:02:51.820 --> 00:02:54.190
<i>The song of destruction</i>

00:02:55.030 --> 00:02:56.500
<i>which signaled the world's demise.</i>

00:03:14.520 --> 00:03:15.670
It's morning.

00:03:15.670 --> 00:03:17.300
Wake up, sleepyhead.

00:03:17.300 --> 00:03:19.090
We've gotten separated from everyone,

00:03:19.600 --> 00:03:20.840
so I'm feeling lonely.

00:03:30.620 --> 00:03:31.810
What the heck is that?!

00:03:40.960 --> 00:03:43.490
That creature feels familiar.

00:03:43.490 --> 00:03:44.410
Huh?

00:03:44.910 --> 00:03:47.750
Make sure not to rely on your 
rewrite ability so readily.

00:03:47.750 --> 00:03:50.660
If you overuse it,
you will cease to be human.

00:03:53.490 --> 00:03:55.630
Is that <i>you</i>?

00:03:58.080 --> 00:03:59.240
Where am I?

00:03:59.590 --> 00:04:00.170
Kagari.

00:04:05.380 --> 00:04:06.050
Kagari...

00:04:07.770 --> 00:04:08.820
Kotarou.

00:04:09.420 --> 00:04:11.680
Is it time for my morning feecof?

00:04:14.750 --> 00:04:15.590
Oh?

00:04:16.040 --> 00:04:19.070
I don't hear that hair-raising song anymore.

00:04:19.960 --> 00:04:20.760
You're right!

00:04:20.760 --> 00:04:23.700
The song of destruction 
stopped at some point!

00:04:27.880 --> 00:04:28.450
Kagari!

00:04:28.910 --> 00:04:30.140
Thank goodness!

00:04:30.140 --> 00:04:31.950
Seriously!

00:04:31.950 --> 00:04:35.460
I honestly thought I'd never
get to see you again.

00:04:36.210 --> 00:04:37.460
Kotarou?

00:04:38.230 --> 00:04:39.930
Is that the Key?

00:04:42.310 --> 00:04:43.470
Esaka-san.

00:04:47.290 --> 00:04:49.350
You don't seem very surprised.

00:04:49.810 --> 00:04:51.850
Something told me you would show up.

00:04:55.970 --> 00:04:59.010
Then you must be aware of what I'm after.

00:04:59.380 --> 00:05:02.610
I will put an end to the Key, here and now.

00:05:02.960 --> 00:05:04.190
I won't let you.

00:05:04.480 --> 00:05:05.450
Kotarou-kun!

00:05:07.100 --> 00:05:09.450
I never expected you to 
have an ability like that.

00:05:13.530 --> 00:05:15.830
<i>This guy is strong!</i>

00:05:19.930 --> 00:05:25.090
<i>I'll never land a hit unless
I shift up one—no, ten gears.</i>

00:05:27.840 --> 00:05:28.760
You...

00:05:34.070 --> 00:05:34.810
What?!

00:05:35.200 --> 00:05:37.850
An opponent with inferior skill
would surely look for

00:05:37.980 --> 00:05:39.810
a surprise attack to my blind spot.

00:05:41.880 --> 00:05:43.650
And, no matter how fast that attack may be,

00:05:43.650 --> 00:05:46.360
it poses no trouble when I know it's coming.

00:05:47.280 --> 00:05:48.380
<i>I was naïve!</i>

00:05:48.380 --> 00:05:50.560
<i>He's too far ahead, 
even if I step it up ten gears!</i>

00:05:50.950 --> 00:05:51.620
<i>Well, then!</i>

00:05:51.810 --> 00:05:53.370
Don't, Kotarou-kun!

00:05:53.530 --> 00:05:56.370
I just have to keep stepping 
it up until I reach him!

00:05:59.740 --> 00:06:00.500
Got you!

00:06:02.250 --> 00:06:03.310
Kotarou...

00:06:12.630 --> 00:06:14.100
Sakuya...

00:06:30.770 --> 00:06:32.320
Sorry, Captain.

00:06:32.890 --> 00:06:35.990
This is the end of the line for the 
Bayern Knights of the Green Sword...

00:06:36.620 --> 00:06:38.690
Hit, and you'll be hit back.

00:06:39.000 --> 00:06:40.870
That goes for Gaia and Guardian alike.

00:06:41.060 --> 00:06:43.620
When it's over something important,
that goes double.

00:06:44.400 --> 00:06:47.620
Talk about a sinful life.

00:06:47.970 --> 00:06:50.880
If there <i>is</i> a world after this one, then...

00:06:52.280 --> 00:06:54.810
As long as I can make delicious ramen,

00:06:54.810 --> 00:06:56.510
that'll be enough for me.

00:07:03.390 --> 00:07:05.020
Your attacks are repetitive!

00:07:05.020 --> 00:07:06.530
Damn it, again!

00:07:07.000 --> 00:07:10.080
They're powerful, but that's all.

00:07:10.080 --> 00:07:13.030
Don't expect a huge swing 
like that to connect twice!

00:07:15.000 --> 00:07:17.620
Attacks should be simple and forceful.

00:07:18.040 --> 00:07:19.250
Kotarou-kun!

00:07:27.500 --> 00:07:28.420
Damn!

00:07:28.420 --> 00:07:29.620
Just a little more!

00:07:30.320 --> 00:07:32.300
The bleeding has stopped?

00:07:32.700 --> 00:07:33.970
That power...

00:07:33.970 --> 00:07:34.850
I get it.

00:07:35.220 --> 00:07:37.560
Your body appears to have remembered.

00:07:37.560 --> 00:07:39.310
What does that mean?

00:07:39.570 --> 00:07:42.300
That's irrelevant to you as you are now.

00:07:44.050 --> 00:07:45.130
What's more,

00:07:45.130 --> 00:07:48.320
I can't stand to see you in 
that sorry state any longer.

00:07:50.050 --> 00:07:51.220
Tennouji...

00:07:51.780 --> 00:07:55.820
If only you hadn't come back 
in such a half-baked condition...

00:07:55.820 --> 00:07:58.330
What the hell are you going on about?

00:08:05.620 --> 00:08:06.460
M-My body—

00:08:07.070 --> 00:08:09.710
The least I can do is to end it in one swing.

00:08:11.320 --> 00:08:12.220
This is farewell.

00:08:12.480 --> 00:08:12.840
Kota—

00:08:12.840 --> 00:08:13.340
Sto—

00:08:15.430 --> 00:08:16.930
Kotarou!

00:08:17.140 --> 00:08:17.430
What?!

00:08:19.540 --> 00:08:20.270
<i>Shizuru!</i>

00:08:20.500 --> 00:08:21.600
<i>Kotarou.</i>

00:08:33.300 --> 00:08:35.720
Talk about reckless.

00:08:35.720 --> 00:08:36.450
Gramps...

00:08:37.470 --> 00:08:38.830
You won't regret this?

00:08:39.010 --> 00:08:39.760
I won't!

00:08:42.060 --> 00:08:43.030
I see.

00:08:43.740 --> 00:08:45.330
Then I have nothing to say.

00:08:45.960 --> 00:08:46.790
Let's go!

00:08:57.720 --> 00:08:59.520
Kotarou...

00:08:59.930 --> 00:09:00.720
Kagari!

00:09:03.240 --> 00:09:05.360
Guess I went up too many gears.

00:09:05.360 --> 00:09:06.230
Crap.

00:09:06.230 --> 00:09:08.150
My body feels like it's going to tear apart!

00:09:08.770 --> 00:09:10.660
Kotarou-kun, are you all ri—

00:09:15.460 --> 00:09:18.220
Looks like the tab I've racked up
is due for payment.

00:09:19.870 --> 00:09:22.440
I'm like a monster, aren't I?

00:09:24.260 --> 00:09:25.160
Sorry.

00:09:25.470 --> 00:09:26.490
I'm so sorry.

00:09:26.490 --> 00:09:27.250
Kotori?

00:09:30.950 --> 00:09:32.750
I did this to you...

00:09:33.110 --> 00:09:35.720
Ah, I see.

00:09:36.200 --> 00:09:39.760
I now understand why I was drawn to Kotarou.

00:09:40.580 --> 00:09:43.240
I am inside him.

00:09:43.240 --> 00:09:45.770
You did this, didn't you, Kotori?

00:09:48.920 --> 00:09:52.270
The day the Key appeared from the power spot,

00:09:52.520 --> 00:09:55.650
I came to the forest for you,

00:09:55.650 --> 00:09:57.880
in order to fulfill my promise as a Druid.

00:10:02.290 --> 00:10:04.730
For some reason, Kotarou was there, too.

00:10:05.790 --> 00:10:08.620
Kotarou-kun! Kotarou-kun!

00:10:06.430 --> 00:10:08.620
And he was near death.

00:10:09.020 --> 00:10:12.470
All I wanted was to save him,

00:10:11.480 --> 00:10:14.130
Please, save Kotarou-kun!

00:10:12.470 --> 00:10:15.130
so I begged you lots and lots.

00:10:15.320 --> 00:10:17.000
I beg of you!

00:10:20.270 --> 00:10:24.230
I embedded your ribbon inside 
Kotarou-kun's right arm,

00:10:24.230 --> 00:10:27.770
and managed to save his life.

00:10:29.090 --> 00:10:30.820
I wanted him to live.

00:10:31.550 --> 00:10:33.900
I didn't want him to disappear 
somewhere far away,

00:10:33.900 --> 00:10:36.610
like my mom and dad had.

00:10:36.610 --> 00:10:40.980
But that ended up making him
suffer all the more!

00:10:43.820 --> 00:10:46.250
H-Hey! Hang in there!

00:10:46.250 --> 00:10:47.120
It is all right.

00:10:47.120 --> 00:10:49.120
He has only lost consciousness.

00:10:49.460 --> 00:10:52.810
My power is too great for humans.

00:10:53.230 --> 00:10:58.240
While it amplified Kotarou's powers,
it also placed a terrible burden upon him.

00:10:58.240 --> 00:10:59.630
Then, what should we do?

00:10:59.900 --> 00:11:03.390
You could remove my power 
and return it to me...

00:11:03.700 --> 00:11:06.800
But then, what will happen to him?

00:11:06.800 --> 00:11:09.050
Your power is what closed his wounds,

00:11:09.050 --> 00:11:11.270
and is keeping him alive.

00:11:11.510 --> 00:11:12.790
I do not know,

00:11:12.790 --> 00:11:14.820
but at this rate,

00:11:14.820 --> 00:11:16.780
he will definitely lose his life.

00:11:19.560 --> 00:11:21.550
Aw, guess we have no choice!

00:11:21.550 --> 00:11:22.530
Indeed.

00:11:24.480 --> 00:11:29.240
Put simply, a huge hole will 
open up in Kotarou-san, correct?

00:11:29.240 --> 00:11:30.110
In that case...

00:11:30.110 --> 00:11:30.740
Yeah!

00:11:30.740 --> 00:11:34.790
With a big man like me around, 
we can fill up any hole!

00:11:34.960 --> 00:11:35.750
Wait!

00:11:35.750 --> 00:11:37.420
Do you realize what you are saying?

00:11:37.660 --> 00:11:41.140
It just happened to work out that way,
but we <i>did</i> form a contract.

00:11:41.140 --> 00:11:43.300
We have to make ourselves useful
once in a while.

00:11:44.960 --> 00:11:46.200
Understood.

00:12:02.700 --> 00:12:03.610
See ya!

00:12:03.610 --> 00:12:06.560
Though it was only for a 
short time, it was fun!

00:12:12.770 --> 00:12:14.330
Kotarou-kun?

00:12:14.900 --> 00:12:15.950
Kotori.

00:12:17.650 --> 00:12:20.210
Want some morning feecof?

00:12:20.680 --> 00:12:21.730
Sounds nice.

00:12:21.730 --> 00:12:22.680
Of course,

00:12:22.680 --> 00:12:25.840
we don't have any beans, 
hot water, sugar, or milk.

00:12:25.840 --> 00:12:30.760
But you're walking around
with cups in this situation?

00:12:33.310 --> 00:12:35.140
Don't push yourself.

00:12:35.140 --> 00:12:38.660
You're just barely alive right now.

00:12:40.910 --> 00:12:42.660
Gil and Pani aren't here, huh?

00:12:43.930 --> 00:12:46.580
Those two ran away.

00:12:47.090 --> 00:12:49.870
They said they couldn't deal with us,
and went far away...

00:12:50.730 --> 00:12:51.740
I see.

00:12:51.740 --> 00:12:53.620
Well, knowing them,

00:12:53.620 --> 00:12:55.370
they'll be fine, wherever they go.

00:12:58.700 --> 00:13:00.180
What's happened?

00:13:00.180 --> 00:13:03.980
Nothing much has changed 
since that song stopped.

00:13:05.390 --> 00:13:06.410
I see.

00:13:07.350 --> 00:13:10.640
Well, I guess <i>I</i> changed a little.

00:13:10.840 --> 00:13:12.200
How so?

00:13:12.200 --> 00:13:16.860
You have not evolved from 
the same foolish, rash,

00:13:16.860 --> 00:13:19.150
blockheaded human you always were.

00:13:19.460 --> 00:13:21.150
Hey, you don't have to force yourself.

00:13:26.060 --> 00:13:26.660
Kagari!

00:13:27.330 --> 00:13:29.320
Kotarou-kun, this is...

00:13:29.320 --> 00:13:30.370
Yeah.

00:13:30.370 --> 00:13:32.660
Damn it, I hear it!

00:13:32.940 --> 00:13:34.890
The song of destruction!

00:13:45.970 --> 00:13:46.800
Kotarou-kun!

00:13:52.320 --> 00:13:53.200
Why?

00:13:53.200 --> 00:13:55.060
He doesn't have Kagari's power anymore!

00:13:57.310 --> 00:14:00.350
There is no point in surviving.

00:14:00.650 --> 00:14:03.320
This land is filled with nothing but sorrow.

00:14:03.570 --> 00:14:06.570
That being so, life is 
unnecessary to this world!

00:14:08.380 --> 00:14:10.900
Let this song resound!

00:14:11.830 --> 00:14:15.490
Destruction is the one and only Salvation

00:14:15.490 --> 00:14:18.180
you foolish lifeforms will be granted!

00:14:21.540 --> 00:14:23.090
The pump has been sufficiently primed.

00:14:23.590 --> 00:14:25.350
Everything is in order.

00:14:25.350 --> 00:14:26.420
Now, Key!

00:14:26.930 --> 00:14:30.300
Grant these sinful lives Salvation!

00:14:34.590 --> 00:14:35.560
Kagari!

00:14:36.730 --> 00:14:38.130
Kagari!

00:15:02.470 --> 00:15:03.590
Kagari!

00:15:10.510 --> 00:15:11.520
Kagari!

00:15:12.940 --> 00:15:14.220
Kotarou-kun!

00:15:20.590 --> 00:15:22.100
Kagari! Kagari!

00:15:29.440 --> 00:15:30.830
Damn it, let go!

00:15:31.300 --> 00:15:34.080
I still need to talk to her!

00:15:34.080 --> 00:15:36.250
Kagari!

00:15:45.260 --> 00:15:47.500
No! Not the face!

00:15:48.060 --> 00:15:51.350
What will I do with you, Kotarou?

00:15:52.900 --> 00:15:55.030
You're always so mean to me...

00:15:55.940 --> 00:15:59.640
You must super-duper totally love me.

00:16:00.570 --> 00:16:01.860
Shut up.

00:16:08.910 --> 00:16:11.250
This is the Salvation?

00:16:12.460 --> 00:16:16.220
The world is going to end, due to my ruling?

00:16:16.540 --> 00:16:17.450
No.

00:16:17.780 --> 00:16:20.430
The other Kagari is the one 
who made the final ruling.

00:16:21.100 --> 00:16:23.400
No, it was me.

00:16:24.560 --> 00:16:27.290
I'm sure there must still be some other way.

00:16:27.570 --> 00:16:29.640
The feecof was delicious.

00:16:29.640 --> 00:16:30.420
Huh?

00:16:30.920 --> 00:16:33.400
The Internet and school were both fun.

00:16:33.850 --> 00:16:37.110
Kotori and the others were 
noteworthy humans, as well.

00:16:37.110 --> 00:16:38.850
What are you...

00:16:38.850 --> 00:16:42.090
And, most of all, the days I spent with you

00:16:42.090 --> 00:16:45.930
were the finest, most irreplaceable memories.

00:16:46.870 --> 00:16:47.690
Kagari?

00:16:48.020 --> 00:16:49.400
Will you

00:16:50.190 --> 00:16:51.690
save this world?

00:16:53.620 --> 00:16:55.450
Do you know what you're saying?!

00:16:55.760 --> 00:16:56.560
Yes.

00:16:57.000 --> 00:17:00.260
I wouldn't mind dying
if it was at your hands.

00:17:11.400 --> 00:17:12.460
Kotarou-kun!

00:17:14.470 --> 00:17:14.720
Huh?

00:17:17.850 --> 00:17:20.720
There's no way I can do that.

00:17:21.010 --> 00:17:23.270
You idiot!

00:17:23.750 --> 00:17:26.480
I... care too much about...

00:17:28.430 --> 00:17:34.130
Kotarou, among all the humans in this world,

00:17:34.130 --> 00:17:37.840
you truly are the most helplessly 
foolish of them all.

00:17:45.740 --> 00:17:46.860
Shall we go?

00:18:04.340 --> 00:18:06.020
Mom?

00:18:10.580 --> 00:18:12.360
I'm hungry.

00:18:12.760 --> 00:18:14.950
Let's eat some saury.

00:18:15.500 --> 00:18:17.080
Dad,

00:18:17.730 --> 00:18:19.540
Mom,

00:18:19.540 --> 00:18:22.600
and Shizuka...

00:18:23.340 --> 00:18:25.540
Let's eat all together.

00:18:26.140 --> 00:18:27.350
Yeah.

00:18:27.660 --> 00:18:29.830
Let's do that tomorrow.

00:18:30.340 --> 00:18:34.300
We aren't alone anymore.

00:18:34.830 --> 00:18:35.810
We'll...

00:18:36.550 --> 00:18:39.300
We'll eat with everyone...

00:18:51.250 --> 00:18:52.060
They're disappearing!

00:18:52.440 --> 00:18:53.710
The world!

00:18:53.710 --> 00:18:55.040
Humans!

00:18:55.480 --> 00:18:57.980
And us!

00:19:03.230 --> 00:19:05.780
Akane...

00:19:15.360 --> 00:19:16.560
Shimako...

00:19:27.580 --> 00:19:30.100
Are you okay, Sakuya?

00:19:30.560 --> 00:19:32.820
I'll pick you up now.

00:19:36.900 --> 00:19:38.400
I never knew.

00:19:38.760 --> 00:19:42.030
You were this heavy, huh?

00:19:42.470 --> 00:19:43.720
From now on,

00:19:45.010 --> 00:19:47.080
I will carry you...

00:19:53.040 --> 00:19:55.290
It was always a rough time,

00:19:57.000 --> 00:20:00.310
but we did everything we could, huh?

00:20:04.080 --> 00:20:05.180
Little one?

00:20:09.050 --> 00:20:09.560
Pero?

00:20:11.130 --> 00:20:12.810
Is it you, Pero?

00:20:19.780 --> 00:20:22.960
You were with me all this time!

00:20:24.260 --> 00:20:27.330
I wonder if we'll get to see everyone again?

00:20:28.710 --> 00:20:31.280
That would be wonderful...

00:21:09.520 --> 00:21:11.900
Everyone is ascending.

00:21:12.560 --> 00:21:15.350
Gaia, Guardian, the Key.

00:21:15.770 --> 00:21:17.480
I was involved with them all,

00:21:18.440 --> 00:21:20.510
but I couldn't do anything.

00:21:22.260 --> 00:21:24.460
If I had a little more time,

00:21:24.460 --> 00:21:26.760
I wonder if I could have 
done everything better?

00:21:27.080 --> 00:21:28.360
It's all right.

00:21:28.360 --> 00:21:30.920
I'm sure you could, Kotarou.

